WEBVTT

01:49.920 --> 01:53.930
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.300 --> 01:56.840
[Episode 19]

02:15.430 --> 02:16.829
How about this, Miss Liu?

02:17.280 --> 02:19.079
As long as you buy me
a string of candied hawthorns,

02:19.079 --> 02:20.340
I'll give this ring...

02:41.960 --> 02:43.760
Where did these shoes come from?

02:44.470 --> 02:47.530
Someone abandoned them
and threw them away, of course.

02:48.520 --> 02:49.560
The owner of these shoes

02:49.560 --> 02:50.190
gave me

02:50.280 --> 02:51.400
5 yellow fish

02:51.630 --> 02:52.910
in exchange for

02:53.079 --> 02:54.490
the only pair of shoes in my shop.

02:54.490 --> 02:55.490
Five yellow fish?

02:55.710 --> 02:56.560
Yeah!

02:57.050 --> 02:59.050
This girl's got real guts.

02:59.470 --> 03:00.080
Of course,

03:00.470 --> 03:02.590
I didn't just take her money
without giving anything.

03:02.590 --> 03:04.030
She said there was something

03:04.030 --> 03:05.470
she really wanted.

03:05.710 --> 03:08.640
But she couldn't get it,
no matter how hard she tried.

03:09.680 --> 03:11.430
She looked quite upset,

03:12.000 --> 03:13.870
so I gave her a suggestion.

03:15.560 --> 03:16.560
What suggestion?

03:22.060 --> 03:22.829
[Marriage Certificate]

03:24.030 --> 03:25.560
There's a rule in Rongcheng.

03:25.560 --> 03:27.280
Once you sign a marriage certificate,

03:27.280 --> 03:29.280
you can obtain any item in the city.

03:29.680 --> 03:31.150
I gave that girl one.

03:31.650 --> 03:33.370
Commander, would you like one, too?

03:33.370 --> 03:34.180
Getting married here

03:34.180 --> 03:35.040
will be damned.

03:35.630 --> 03:36.800
Boss, why are you cursing me?

03:36.800 --> 03:39.260
T-This is
just part of my character setting.

03:43.630 --> 03:44.280
Li Yue!

03:46.750 --> 03:48.000
Do you listen to me?

03:49.960 --> 03:51.030
Then marry me.

03:51.800 --> 03:53.730
You got the marriage certificate?

03:53.730 --> 03:56.110
But it needs the signature
of a mayoral candidate

03:56.110 --> 03:57.870
before it can be sent
to the registration office to take effect.

03:57.870 --> 03:59.910
Let's go get Chief Feng's signature.

03:59.910 --> 04:00.430
Nope,

04:00.970 --> 04:02.230
I have someone in mind.

04:04.110 --> 04:06.360
[Marriage Certificate
Zhang Bolun, Liu Rushi]

04:08.150 --> 04:09.030
Commander Qin,

04:09.310 --> 04:11.150
no one in Rongcheng is more suitable

04:11.150 --> 04:13.150
than you to be our marriage witness.

04:14.280 --> 04:15.190
It's fine

04:15.360 --> 04:17.430
if you don't want to give this ring to me.

04:17.430 --> 04:18.240
Li Yue and I...

04:20.240 --> 04:21.160
Zhang Bolun.

04:22.720 --> 04:23.560
Bolun and I...

04:25.640 --> 04:26.680
We're getting it no matter what.

04:26.680 --> 04:27.510
Now,

04:27.560 --> 04:29.350
please be our marriage witness

04:29.800 --> 04:30.860
and help sign this.

04:33.920 --> 04:35.120
What do you see in him?

04:35.920 --> 04:37.520
He's optimistic, cheerful,

04:37.560 --> 04:38.560
and friendly.

04:39.750 --> 04:41.800
And he does whatever I say.

04:42.630 --> 04:43.690
Most importantly,

04:44.190 --> 04:45.270
he likes me.

04:55.750 --> 04:57.310
Is your relationship real?

04:57.510 --> 04:58.510
Absolutely real.

05:01.040 --> 05:01.900
Commander Qin,

05:02.120 --> 05:02.830
please rest assured.

05:02.830 --> 05:04.560
I promise I will treat her well.

05:10.390 --> 05:12.190
You've asked enough questions.

05:12.510 --> 05:13.630
Please sign it now.

05:18.920 --> 05:19.560
Actually, you could...

05:19.560 --> 05:20.240
Commander.

05:21.870 --> 05:23.070
If shoes don't fit,

05:23.070 --> 05:24.240
I'll just get a new pair.

05:24.240 --> 05:25.190
If a path leads nowhere,

05:25.190 --> 05:26.650
I'll take a different one.

05:27.040 --> 05:28.630
If one person is not right for me,

05:28.630 --> 05:30.390
I'll just find someone similar.

05:30.390 --> 05:31.320
It's no big deal.

05:59.720 --> 06:00.190
Bye.

06:22.510 --> 06:24.830
This marriage certificate
cannot be validated.

06:24.830 --> 06:25.600
Why?

06:30.930 --> 06:33.290
[In your dreams.]

06:34.190 --> 06:35.190
Day is breaking.

06:35.190 --> 06:37.520
Miss, I'm afraid you'll have to accept it.

06:58.640 --> 07:03.160
[Rongcheng Civil Affairs Bureau]

07:03.920 --> 07:05.250
Do you enjoy fooling me?

07:08.390 --> 07:09.720
Do you still think

07:10.390 --> 07:12.790
that anyone
can play the role of Qin Xiaoyi?

07:18.040 --> 07:20.630
Others will be defeated by you
over and over again.

07:20.630 --> 07:21.310
But I won't.

07:22.680 --> 07:23.610
So it's a mistake

07:24.270 --> 07:26.000
for you to choose someone else.

07:26.140 --> 07:27.870
You should win the game with me.

07:37.830 --> 07:39.230
Have you ever considered

07:40.070 --> 07:41.800
what I'm really fretting over?

07:51.950 --> 07:52.600
Forget it.

07:53.510 --> 07:54.710
Both on stage and off,

07:55.470 --> 07:58.200
I don't want to guess
what's in your mind anymore.

07:58.390 --> 08:01.360
I'm sick of you messing with me
and then helping me,

08:01.600 --> 08:03.120
pushing me away
and then coming back to me.

08:03.120 --> 08:04.480
I can't help but have my mood

08:04.480 --> 08:06.320
fluctuate up and down
due to your attitude.

08:06.320 --> 08:07.920
Why should I put up with this?

08:20.460 --> 08:21.630
The game is over.

08:25.560 --> 08:27.620
I don't care about winning or losing.

08:34.020 --> 08:34.570
And you

08:35.080 --> 08:36.809
also don't concern me anymore.

09:29.150 --> 09:33.100
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

09:33.520 --> 09:37.250
♪ The motionless night began to shimmer ♪

09:37.730 --> 09:42.010
♪ The fireworks bear witness, as if ♪

09:42.270 --> 09:45.500
♪ They're waiting for the words
we want to say ♪

09:45.960 --> 09:49.250
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

09:50.460 --> 09:55.750
♪ It felt as if two lonely islands
had finally ♪

09:56.380 --> 10:00.990
♪ Gotten closer and slipped into
the flow of time together ♪

10:01.720 --> 10:05.580
♪ I won't wander anymore ♪

10:02.870 --> 10:04.130
Don't end it like this.

10:19.110 --> 10:25.750
♪ As long as we're together, we can
empathize with even the falling leaves ♪

10:26.580 --> 10:30.250
♪ The secrets in memory are ♪

10:30.800 --> 10:34.010
♪ Exchanged in our eyes
as we're being brave ♪

10:34.460 --> 10:38.510
♪ How long have we waited
to grow familiar from strangers? ♪

10:38.640 --> 10:42.720
♪ Destiny made me cross paths with you ♪

10:43.560 --> 10:46.010
♪ I hold you in my heart ♪

10:46.030 --> 10:52.310
♪ Belief itself works wonders for life ♪

10:52.950 --> 10:56.240
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

10:57.450 --> 11:02.740
♪ It felt as if two lonely islands
had finally ♪

11:03.380 --> 11:08.870
♪ Held hands and slipped into
the flow of time together ♪

11:04.120 --> 11:05.150
Where is Qin Xiaoyi?

11:05.150 --> 11:06.000
Where did Qin Xiaoyi go?

11:06.000 --> 11:07.400
No idea. I didn't see him.

11:09.670 --> 11:10.840
Dear players, please

11:09.710 --> 11:13.080
♪ I won't wander anymore ♪

11:10.840 --> 11:12.300
exit in an orderly manner.

11:16.150 --> 11:16.680
Let's go.

11:25.160 --> 11:26.220
S-Someone is coming.

11:26.220 --> 11:27.220
What should we do?

11:40.840 --> 11:42.150
What are you doing here?

11:42.150 --> 11:43.390
Just now, when the game ended,

11:43.390 --> 11:45.940
quite a few players were asking
where you went.

11:45.940 --> 11:47.960
Looking forward to seeing you again
in Rongcheng.

11:47.960 --> 11:49.690
-See you again.
-See you again.

11:54.590 --> 11:55.160
Let's go.

11:58.750 --> 11:59.720
Time to go.

12:09.840 --> 12:10.640
Are they gone?

12:11.620 --> 12:12.080
Come on.

12:12.590 --> 12:13.250
Be careful.

12:17.840 --> 12:19.000
I'll take my leave now.

12:19.000 --> 12:20.620
The next group will be coming soon.

12:20.620 --> 12:21.100
Hold on.

12:27.350 --> 12:27.880
Go ahead.

12:28.100 --> 12:29.900
I'll wait for you outside later.

12:42.080 --> 12:42.960
You know,

12:42.960 --> 12:44.710
my acting style is kind of different

12:44.710 --> 12:46.110
from Qin Xiaoyi's today.

12:46.380 --> 12:47.440
Not quite the same.

12:47.630 --> 12:48.160
Really?

12:48.180 --> 12:48.610
Yes.

12:50.150 --> 12:50.550
Xiu.

12:50.740 --> 12:51.940
When did you come out?

12:52.440 --> 12:53.150
Just now.

12:53.540 --> 12:54.740
You didn't notice it.

12:55.000 --> 12:55.600
Is that so?

12:55.630 --> 12:56.960
It was quite fun today.

12:57.080 --> 12:57.720
Yeah.

13:17.510 --> 13:19.000
I think
the murder mystery game is pretty fun.

13:19.000 --> 13:19.550
Yep,

13:20.110 --> 13:21.180
it's really interesting.

13:21.180 --> 13:23.660
And I think
Li Yue is good at deduction, too.

13:46.680 --> 13:47.940
Did you just peek at me?

13:49.360 --> 13:51.240
I was looking quite openly.

13:52.720 --> 13:54.920
When we were getting out, did you notice

13:54.960 --> 13:56.480
that Qin Xiaoyi's lipstick shade today

13:56.480 --> 13:57.390
looked pretty nice?

13:57.390 --> 13:58.750
I was thinking the same thing.

13:58.750 --> 14:00.150
But I remember

14:00.150 --> 14:01.030
during the game,

14:01.030 --> 14:02.830
he wasn't wearing any lipstick.

14:03.070 --> 14:03.670
Thank you.

14:08.920 --> 14:10.450
The pocket watch, the ring.

14:10.720 --> 14:11.790
If we keep playing like this,

14:11.790 --> 14:13.200
Commander Qin, all your ornaments

14:13.200 --> 14:14.440
will be mine.

14:15.390 --> 14:16.720
Then just take them all.

14:16.720 --> 14:17.360
Really?

14:18.260 --> 14:20.480
Then, Commander Qin,
you'd better think carefully

14:20.480 --> 14:22.880
about what you'll let me take next time.

14:25.910 --> 14:27.170
Have you seen Mr. Xiao?

14:32.550 --> 14:33.810
Are you waiting for me?

14:35.630 --> 14:36.160
Perfect.

14:36.170 --> 14:38.170
I didn't drive today. Give me a ride.

14:41.630 --> 14:42.160
Let's go.

14:44.960 --> 14:46.160
Then I'll take a taxi.

14:46.210 --> 14:47.690
Come on! Don't take a taxi.

14:47.750 --> 14:48.320
It's on our way.

14:48.320 --> 14:50.050
We'll drive you home. Let's go.

14:52.920 --> 14:53.720
Get in the car.

14:59.550 --> 15:01.160
Let's take Hu Xiu home first.
She lives close by.

15:01.160 --> 15:02.560
We'll drop you off first.

15:29.630 --> 15:30.360
Wait, Hu Xiu.

15:30.510 --> 15:31.840
Your hair is a bit messy.

15:32.950 --> 15:33.580
Is it?

15:43.840 --> 15:45.150
Come on, you two.

15:45.560 --> 15:47.360
You think you can hide it from me?

15:50.750 --> 15:53.080
You're still falling out with each other.

15:55.660 --> 15:57.320
I just found it weird earlier.

15:57.480 --> 15:58.630
You were standing together at the gate,

15:58.630 --> 15:59.720
yet back to back.

16:00.320 --> 16:01.120
You didn't say a word

16:01.120 --> 16:02.050
all the way here.

16:02.070 --> 16:04.270
I had to be the one making conversation.

16:08.750 --> 16:10.950
You two have been like this
for a while now.

16:10.950 --> 16:13.680
What's this big conflict
that you can't resolve?

16:13.860 --> 16:15.390
What on earth are you mad at?

16:16.150 --> 16:17.120
Don't say anything.

16:17.120 --> 16:17.670
Xiao,

16:18.270 --> 16:20.320
Hu Xiu is a girl.

16:20.320 --> 16:21.600
It's normal for her to be shy.

16:21.600 --> 16:23.140
You should take the initiative.

16:23.140 --> 16:24.030
You have a mouth.

16:24.030 --> 16:26.270
Isn't it
for clearing up misunderstandings?

16:26.270 --> 16:26.840
Right?

16:28.160 --> 16:28.680
Hu Xiu,

16:28.700 --> 16:29.530
want a mint?

16:30.710 --> 16:31.320
Yes.

16:38.240 --> 16:39.590
What flavor is this mint?

16:39.590 --> 16:40.920
Tastes like a mothball.

16:41.840 --> 16:43.130
Hu Xiu, don't eat it.

16:48.080 --> 16:49.840
I think it's quite sweet.

16:53.320 --> 16:54.600
Your taste is

16:54.830 --> 16:55.680
quite unique.

17:03.190 --> 17:07.210
♪ Under streetlights, I grow tired again ♪

17:09.599 --> 17:13.710
♪ Dust in the wind
drifts past now and then ♪

17:16.500 --> 17:20.710
♪That girl who once ran in the sun
so bright ♪

17:21.560 --> 17:24.170
♪ Where did she go tonight? ♪

17:24.859 --> 17:27.210
♪ I don't really know why ♪

17:29.700 --> 17:33.700
♪ Scrolling old lines
we once said before ♪

17:36.340 --> 17:40.950
♪ Echoes reply just a second too slow ♪

17:42.050 --> 17:44.960
♪ At the edge of the road ♪

17:44.980 --> 17:48.000
♪ In the crowd, in the night ♪

17:49.860 --> 17:56.170
♪ Who hasn't paid the price
and still fell down ♪

17:56.870 --> 18:00.630
♪ Stay with me tonight,
look at the starlights ♪

18:01.840 --> 18:07.510
♪ Even when life feels absurd
like a stage ♪

18:08.840 --> 18:14.010
♪ Every step feels so hard ♪

18:15.540 --> 18:19.270
♪ But in this world
there's always someone ♪

18:19.680 --> 18:24.520
♪ Who starts again just like I am ♪

18:28.000 --> 18:28.860
We've arrived.

18:32.550 --> 18:33.720
Alright, I'm going.

18:34.310 --> 18:36.440
Make sure you drive Hu Xiu home safely.

18:36.680 --> 18:37.210
Bye-bye.

18:37.310 --> 18:37.920
Bye-bye.

18:48.230 --> 18:49.290
Are you free later?

18:51.920 --> 18:53.320
Then let's go to my place.

19:16.140 --> 19:16.820
Come in.

19:28.480 --> 19:29.280
What's wrong?

19:30.210 --> 19:30.930
Nothing.

19:33.640 --> 19:34.510
I only have men's slippers.

19:34.510 --> 19:35.510
Make do with them.

19:42.720 --> 19:43.920
What would you like to drink?

19:43.920 --> 19:45.070
There's water in the fridge.

19:45.070 --> 19:46.070
And here, some...

19:47.110 --> 19:48.110
Water is fine!

19:48.720 --> 19:50.310
I-I'll get it myself.

19:53.000 --> 19:54.120
The fridge is over there.

19:54.120 --> 19:54.840
Have a seat.

19:54.920 --> 19:55.720
Just a moment.

20:45.640 --> 20:47.480
His home is basically

20:48.300 --> 20:49.960
no different from the studio.

21:23.440 --> 21:25.520
What is he doing?

21:29.480 --> 21:30.340
Come over here.

21:49.270 --> 21:51.880
The follow-up to Lyman's project is
all engineering work.

21:51.880 --> 21:53.280
You're officially on the team now.

21:53.280 --> 21:54.720
You'll be in charge
of project design one day.

21:54.720 --> 21:56.240
These materials will come in handy.

21:56.240 --> 21:57.770
Choose some and take a look.

22:01.180 --> 22:02.580
So you took me to your home

22:02.610 --> 22:04.240
for this reason?

22:09.000 --> 22:11.400
I mean, I'll work hard and do my best.

22:11.780 --> 22:13.980
I'll study these materials carefully.

22:15.590 --> 22:16.550
It's getting late.

22:16.550 --> 22:17.950
Mr. Xiao, I should go now.

22:30.470 --> 22:32.990
Although I do love this job so much,

22:33.590 --> 22:34.750
at this moment,

22:35.500 --> 22:37.020
you're kind of in the way.

22:54.360 --> 22:56.140
You're not another hallucination, are you?

22:56.140 --> 23:00.690
♪ Close your eyes for me ♪

23:02.220 --> 23:04.390
♪ Don't rush to wake up ♪

23:04.860 --> 23:08.080
♪ Before the night ends ♪

23:05.960 --> 23:06.590
Mr. Xiao.

23:10.200 --> 23:11.070
Xiao Zhiyu,

23:10.960 --> 23:16.280
♪ Will you stay with me? ♪

23:11.720 --> 23:12.920
I just want to ask you.

23:13.750 --> 23:14.880
Are we

23:15.160 --> 23:16.880
in a relationship now?

23:17.200 --> 23:19.200
♪ I won't search for ♪

23:18.400 --> 23:19.660
What else do you think?

23:20.000 --> 23:22.810
♪ The reason we met ♪

23:24.030 --> 23:25.400
I'm not like someone.

23:24.580 --> 23:30.110
♪ The city gradually turns pale
outside the window ♪

23:25.920 --> 23:27.030
Someone kissed me

23:27.440 --> 23:29.300
and brushed it off as an accident.

23:29.440 --> 23:31.490
I take full responsibility for my actions.

23:31.490 --> 23:33.610
♪ The stars twinkle ♪

23:33.550 --> 23:34.830
So, how are you
going to take responsibility?

23:34.600 --> 23:38.610
♪ I've quieted down ♪

23:36.950 --> 23:37.600
Hu Xiu.

23:39.800 --> 23:40.670
I love you.

23:40.340 --> 23:43.540
♪ What kind of story will you like? ♪

23:43.660 --> 23:45.320
♪ Would you join me? ♪

23:44.590 --> 23:45.880
I know you're always brave

23:45.350 --> 23:49.110
♪ To make a long, romantic dream ♪

23:46.110 --> 23:46.830
and candid,

23:47.270 --> 23:48.730
and you hate uncertainty.

23:49.830 --> 23:52.400
♪ Just you and me ♪

23:50.110 --> 23:51.640
Yet I've been running away,

23:51.960 --> 23:52.720
hesitating,

23:53.480 --> 23:55.120
afraid to face my own feelings.

23:55.120 --> 23:57.300
♪ Briefly, beyond the clamor ♪

23:56.440 --> 23:57.330
On that New Year's Day,

23:57.330 --> 23:59.310
♪ Carefully drawing close to you ♪

23:57.550 --> 23:58.440
it was my fault.

23:59.340 --> 24:02.780
♪ Clinging to that trace of unknown joy ♪

24:00.030 --> 24:01.070
Not showing up to move out,

24:01.070 --> 24:02.330
that was my fault, too.

24:03.220 --> 24:06.910
♪ Oh, special night ♪

24:05.680 --> 24:06.750
So now you've

24:07.110 --> 24:08.510
made up your mind?

24:09.970 --> 24:14.660
♪ I need you maybe ♪

24:11.160 --> 24:12.830
I didn't just make up my mind.

24:14.000 --> 24:15.600
Actually, I knew it long ago.

24:15.950 --> 24:17.950
♪ The crowds are gone ♪

24:16.110 --> 24:17.910
Even if I take 10,000 steps back,

24:18.240 --> 24:20.200
I'd still find every possible way
to return to your side.

24:18.630 --> 24:22.160
♪ My thoughts have sunk to the bottom ♪

24:21.200 --> 24:21.960
Actually,

24:22.720 --> 24:24.400
I think I've had this resolve
for quite a while.

24:24.280 --> 24:29.410
♪ Maybe you never noticed me at all ♪

24:25.350 --> 24:27.210
It's just that I can't hide it now.

24:28.200 --> 24:28.960
So...

24:30.640 --> 24:31.480
So...

24:31.120 --> 24:36.660
♪ Yet you're in my view ♪

24:34.510 --> 24:36.480
You won't push me away ever again?

24:38.270 --> 24:40.810
♪ Escape the world ♪

24:40.840 --> 24:42.840
♪ Forget all things ♪

24:42.860 --> 24:46.220
♪ And fall down a long, romantic dream ♪

24:43.830 --> 24:45.430
Then no matter what happens,

24:46.000 --> 24:47.510
you must face it with me.

24:46.240 --> 24:48.550
♪ Just you and me ♪

24:49.240 --> 24:51.560
♪ Under moonlight ♪

24:53.920 --> 24:56.490
♪ Briefly, beyond the clamor ♪

24:56.160 --> 24:56.680
Then...

24:56.530 --> 24:58.430
♪ Getting closer to you secretly ♪

24:57.310 --> 24:58.590
Then I want to "stamp it."

24:58.450 --> 25:02.300
♪ Clinging to that trace of unknown joy ♪

24:59.240 --> 24:59.900
"Stamp it"?

25:00.960 --> 25:02.440
Are we signing a contract or what?

25:02.440 --> 25:05.030
What if you hide your resolve again?

25:02.690 --> 25:06.700
♪ Oh, special night ♪

25:05.750 --> 25:07.000
It took me great effort

25:07.000 --> 25:08.600
to bring it out into the open.

25:08.900 --> 25:13.060
♪ Why you were always here ♪

25:11.270 --> 25:11.790
Fine.

25:11.960 --> 25:12.720
Tell me

25:12.720 --> 25:13.720
how you want to stamp it.

25:13.720 --> 25:14.450
Pinky swear?

25:14.770 --> 25:17.100
♪ Is it that you're ♪

25:17.860 --> 25:21.020
♪ Also plucking up courage? ♪

25:23.290 --> 25:28.470
♪ Why you can't hear me ♪

25:29.810 --> 25:32.030
♪ When the day breaks ♪

25:31.310 --> 25:31.770
Come on.

25:31.960 --> 25:32.690
It's your turn now.

25:32.690 --> 25:36.280
♪ Maybe the heartbeat will be clear ♪

25:35.160 --> 25:35.880
Hu Xiu,

25:36.070 --> 25:37.590
I'm almost 30.

25:36.810 --> 25:39.790
♪ Even if the story ♪

25:38.790 --> 25:40.750
So what if you're 30?

25:40.070 --> 25:43.020
♪ Already has countless endings ♪

25:44.620 --> 25:51.700
♪ I'll still walk straight towards you ♪

25:53.250 --> 25:55.040
♪ Escape the world ♪

25:54.350 --> 25:56.350
I'm not playing these childish games.

25:55.050 --> 25:57.050
♪ Forget all things ♪

25:57.070 --> 26:00.430
♪ And fall down a long, romantic dream ♪

26:00.450 --> 26:02.760
♪ Just you and me ♪

26:03.100 --> 26:05.420
♪ Under moonlight ♪

26:07.980 --> 26:10.300
♪ Briefly, beyond the clamor ♪

26:10.320 --> 26:12.220
♪ Getting closer to you secretly ♪

26:12.300 --> 26:16.150
♪ Clinging to that trace of unknown joy ♪

26:16.410 --> 26:20.420
♪ Oh, special night ♪

26:23.740 --> 26:28.010
♪ We will meet tomorrow ♪

26:29.270 --> 26:30.880
♪ I know ♪

26:31.280 --> 26:35.520
♪ Oh, special night ♪

26:38.620 --> 26:43.430
♪ Oh, special night ♪

27:04.880 --> 27:05.990
How narcissistic.

27:20.840 --> 27:23.160
This looks like a really old manuscript.

27:30.640 --> 27:31.350
Q?

28:38.100 --> 28:39.300
We have guests today?

28:40.350 --> 28:41.550
It's Madam's birthday.

28:41.550 --> 28:42.840
Mr. Xiao should be coming.

28:42.840 --> 28:45.040
Better to prepare more than not enough.

28:48.220 --> 28:48.870
I'll go.

28:58.510 --> 29:00.240
At least you show some filial piety.

29:00.240 --> 29:01.840
It's not your place to judge.

29:02.390 --> 29:03.270
On New Year's Eve,

29:03.270 --> 29:06.000
Mrs. Xiao literally
hustled around for nothing.

29:07.880 --> 29:08.720
Zhiyu?

29:10.000 --> 29:11.000
Welcome, Zhiyu.

29:11.760 --> 29:13.360
Now our whole family is here.

29:14.100 --> 29:14.600
Come on,

29:14.990 --> 29:15.680
let's eat.

29:20.880 --> 29:21.480
Mrs. Xiao,

29:22.070 --> 29:23.000
happy birthday.

29:28.960 --> 29:30.240
I was just about to ask someone

29:30.240 --> 29:31.830
to buy me this set of tools.

29:32.140 --> 29:34.080
I noticed the tools
you were using before weren't very handy,

29:34.080 --> 29:36.480
so I thought of giving you
a set of good ones.

29:36.720 --> 29:37.270
He's

29:37.680 --> 29:39.080
so good at picking gifts.

29:39.400 --> 29:41.180
Last year, when you were into painting,

29:41.180 --> 29:42.240
he got you an easel.

29:42.720 --> 29:44.750
This year, you're interested in gardening,

29:44.750 --> 29:45.810
so he got you tools.

29:47.070 --> 29:48.400
That's so thoughtful of you, Zhen.

29:48.400 --> 29:49.270
Thank you.

29:49.350 --> 29:50.480
I'm glad you like it.

29:54.380 --> 29:55.310
Happy birthday.

30:12.310 --> 30:13.240
I remember

30:13.790 --> 30:14.790
when I was little,

30:15.550 --> 30:17.410
you loved listening to her songs.

30:18.550 --> 30:19.350
Yes,

30:20.120 --> 30:22.160
that was many years ago.

30:29.960 --> 30:30.790
Do you like it?

30:31.680 --> 30:32.810
Where did you get it?

30:32.840 --> 30:33.830
Is it a genuine one?

30:33.830 --> 30:34.550
Of course.

30:34.710 --> 30:36.770
I had someone bring it from Hong Kong.

31:08.140 --> 31:10.310
Now that the children
have given their gifts,

31:10.310 --> 31:11.640
I'd like to make a toast.

31:12.920 --> 31:13.640
Wish you

31:14.140 --> 31:15.600
a happy birthday, Wanyue.

31:16.750 --> 31:17.750
Thanks to Wanyue,

31:18.010 --> 31:19.810
we are reunited here as a family.

31:19.960 --> 31:20.470
Cheers.

31:21.240 --> 31:22.000
I'll drive.

31:22.030 --> 31:23.360
So let me toast with tea.

31:24.720 --> 31:25.810
I'd like to take this chance

31:25.810 --> 31:28.740
to wish our two companies
a successful partnership.

31:35.510 --> 31:36.160
Zhiyu,

31:36.890 --> 31:38.240
I'm so happy that you're

31:38.460 --> 31:39.740
working with Zhen.

31:41.030 --> 31:41.750
Mrs. Xiao,

31:41.830 --> 31:43.360
don't worry about the work.

31:43.790 --> 31:45.720
Zhiyu and I will cooperate well.

31:46.720 --> 31:48.640
You both work so hard.

31:48.920 --> 31:50.920
I'm not worried about your careers.

31:51.440 --> 31:53.240
But your marriages are

31:53.830 --> 31:55.290
what I'm concerned about.

31:56.110 --> 31:57.680
You're not getting any younger.

31:57.680 --> 31:59.340
Why aren't you dating anyone?

32:03.480 --> 32:04.400
Young people

32:04.480 --> 32:06.210
should focus on their careers.

32:06.640 --> 32:07.790
Marriage can wait.

32:09.960 --> 32:11.310
No need to rush into marriage.

32:11.310 --> 32:13.440
But they should at least date someone.

32:13.640 --> 32:16.030
Don't you even have a girl you like?

32:17.950 --> 32:18.670
Mrs. Xiao,

32:19.360 --> 32:20.620
I'm in love with a girl.

32:23.710 --> 32:26.310
I'll bring her to meet you
when I get the chance.

32:26.960 --> 32:28.020
That's wonderful.

32:28.200 --> 32:29.440
What's she like?

32:31.030 --> 32:32.590
She's very smart

32:32.880 --> 32:33.750
and cute, too.

32:34.310 --> 32:35.750
We met at work.

32:36.000 --> 32:37.000
I admire her a lot.

32:37.210 --> 32:38.450
You met at work?

32:38.480 --> 32:39.630
Does she also work in construction?

32:39.630 --> 32:40.630
A designer?

32:41.110 --> 32:41.790
Yes.

32:42.340 --> 32:44.200
I really like her way of doing things.

32:44.200 --> 32:45.000
And also,

32:46.110 --> 32:47.770
she understands me very well.

32:58.130 --> 32:59.460
What does her family do?

33:04.130 --> 33:05.790
I'm not quite sure about that.

33:05.790 --> 33:07.650
But according to what I've heard,

33:07.790 --> 33:08.790
her father

33:09.030 --> 33:10.290
should be an engineer.

33:12.610 --> 33:14.010
Just an ordinary family.

33:15.550 --> 33:17.200
A regular engineer.

33:17.820 --> 33:19.790
Her family background must be ordinary.

33:19.790 --> 33:21.520
A girl like that can't help you.

33:21.880 --> 33:23.400
She's not worth your time.

33:24.270 --> 33:26.400
You should focus on your work instead.

33:32.070 --> 33:34.960
So your standards for a spouse are

33:35.350 --> 33:36.750
so pragmatic, Uncle Pei.

33:44.750 --> 33:45.440
Zhiyu,

33:45.680 --> 33:47.740
that's not what your Uncle Pei meant.

33:48.680 --> 33:49.640
Let's eat now.

33:58.200 --> 33:58.960
Zhiyu,

33:59.350 --> 34:01.550
are you sure you won't stay a bit longer?

34:01.870 --> 34:03.530
I still have work to deal with.

34:04.590 --> 34:06.120
I'll see him out, Mrs. Xiao.

34:06.510 --> 34:08.310
We can talk about work on the way.

34:08.840 --> 34:09.400
Okay.

34:09.420 --> 34:10.679
Be careful on your way.

34:10.710 --> 34:11.239
Alright.

34:24.590 --> 34:27.480
There's no problem
with the supplier info this time, right?

34:27.480 --> 34:29.679
When will we sign the project contract?

34:29.880 --> 34:31.510
That depends on Lyman's side.

34:31.510 --> 34:34.040
The financial audit
probably isn't done yet.

34:35.440 --> 34:37.139
This is the standard procedure.

34:37.139 --> 34:39.139
I also want to push forward quickly,

34:39.139 --> 34:40.400
but I can't interfere.

34:43.360 --> 34:44.000
Fine.

34:44.670 --> 34:46.670
Then we'll wait for news from Lyman.

34:48.760 --> 34:51.690
You'd better not mention her
in front of your father.

34:57.590 --> 34:59.630
Who are you to make demands of me?

35:03.550 --> 35:04.710
In other words,

35:05.360 --> 35:06.590
what are you to her?

35:16.810 --> 35:19.470
You heard what your father said
during the meal.

35:19.740 --> 35:20.970
You know what kind of person he is

35:20.970 --> 35:22.160
better than I do.

35:23.720 --> 35:24.250
Pei Zhen,

35:24.920 --> 35:26.550
don't let your wishful thinking

35:26.550 --> 35:28.070
cause Hu Xiu any harm.

35:29.890 --> 35:32.690
She has no obligation
to face your father with you.

36:00.960 --> 36:02.780
Mr. Xiao, are you there?

36:04.790 --> 36:06.150
[Hu Xiu]

36:10.230 --> 36:12.710
Do you have anything to report to me?

36:14.320 --> 36:15.070
Mr. Xiao,

36:15.440 --> 36:17.070
I was reviewing those materials yesterday

36:17.070 --> 36:18.440
until 3 a.m.

36:18.440 --> 36:20.500
Does that count as working overtime?

36:20.880 --> 36:21.880
So you just got up?

36:23.880 --> 36:25.880
While I was going through the materials,

36:25.880 --> 36:27.210
I got some inspiration.

36:27.550 --> 36:28.950
Would you like to hear it?

36:30.000 --> 36:31.030
On our first day of dating,

36:31.030 --> 36:33.490
are you sure
you want to bring up work with me?

36:35.150 --> 36:37.510
Do you have any other plans then?

36:39.030 --> 36:39.590
Go home.

36:43.030 --> 36:43.560
Alright.

36:43.920 --> 36:45.000
Then I'll go to Regard Café

36:45.000 --> 36:47.800
to help Zhao
prepare for the collaboration event.

36:48.440 --> 36:50.770
Do you have something urgent to do
at home?

36:50.960 --> 36:52.480
Yes, I do have something important to do.

36:52.480 --> 36:54.540
I'm going to meet someone important.

36:54.960 --> 36:55.880
Who is it?

36:57.920 --> 36:59.980
Wait, someone is knocking at my door.

37:33.100 --> 37:35.230
You're not washing your hair, are you?

37:41.800 --> 37:44.030
It's not like I haven't seen you
with greasy hair before.

37:44.030 --> 37:45.240
That's different.

37:45.590 --> 37:46.880
Dating etiquette.

37:47.360 --> 37:49.190
During the 3 months of "honeymoon" phase,

37:49.190 --> 37:51.790
you can't see your boyfriend
with greasy hair.

37:55.350 --> 37:56.620
Dating etiquette?

37:57.530 --> 37:59.130
You seem quite experienced.

38:01.760 --> 38:02.630
Are you upset?

38:13.470 --> 38:14.730
Are you upset for real?

38:18.840 --> 38:19.440
Head down.

38:35.250 --> 38:37.450
Only 3 months in the "honeymoon" phase?

38:37.910 --> 38:39.750
Your ex wasn't that great then.

38:47.480 --> 38:49.320
I'll dry my hair.

38:50.060 --> 38:51.790
And then let's go watch a movie?

38:53.670 --> 38:54.280
Okay.

38:54.670 --> 38:55.710
What do you want to watch?

38:55.710 --> 38:56.710
Anything is fine.

39:01.700 --> 39:03.260
[Handwash]

39:04.070 --> 39:05.630
What did you wash your hair with?

39:05.630 --> 39:06.550
Shampoo, of course.

39:06.550 --> 39:07.760
What else would I use?

39:14.030 --> 39:14.670
Oh, no.

39:15.030 --> 39:16.030
I was so busy talking to you

39:16.030 --> 39:18.560
that I ended up
using hand sanitizer instead.

39:18.850 --> 39:20.250
My hair is ruined.

39:23.430 --> 39:24.690
I won't go bald, will I?

39:26.600 --> 39:27.440
What now?

39:34.400 --> 39:36.260
You're so violent with yourself.

39:37.230 --> 39:38.630
My hair feels

39:38.960 --> 39:39.670
even worse

39:39.670 --> 39:40.930
than when you arrived.

39:43.140 --> 39:43.660
Come on.

39:48.590 --> 39:49.790
It's all falling out.

39:51.960 --> 39:52.820
Smells so good.

39:55.410 --> 39:57.610
Isn't this the coconut oil Zhao gave me?

39:59.710 --> 40:02.370
It's now the best
for emergency hair treatment.

40:03.030 --> 40:03.920
This can work?

40:05.960 --> 40:06.510
Yes.

40:06.920 --> 40:07.880
The only downside is

40:07.880 --> 40:10.510
that you might get coconut flakes
falling from your hair later.

40:10.510 --> 40:11.570
Coconut flakes...

40:12.920 --> 40:13.980
What a cringy joke.

40:47.280 --> 40:48.880
You're quite professional.

40:50.440 --> 40:53.240
Are you implying
I have a lot of experience as well?

40:56.150 --> 40:57.000
I used to do

40:57.760 --> 40:59.890
a part-time job at a hair salon abroad.

41:00.760 --> 41:03.150
So, were you called

41:03.380 --> 41:04.610
Tony Xiao back then?

41:06.130 --> 41:07.450
Not that common name.

41:09.760 --> 41:10.820
I was called Kevin.

41:10.920 --> 41:11.670
Kevin?

41:12.950 --> 41:15.060
Sounds like a chief hair stylist.
